{
  "description": "Tools the Claude Code CLI agent may call, each with its own allowlist. Everything starts denied: a tool is callable only when enabled, and a call is accepted only when every scoped argument is in that tool's allow lists and within its limits. Empty allow list or zero limit means nothing is allowed. candidates lists values the specs mention; move a value into allow only after a test exercises it. verifiedBy must cover every allowed value plus one denied value. A schemaHash that no longer matches the tool's input schema means the tool is treated as disabled. See docs/adr/0005-local-claude-inference.md.",
  "mcpServer": "nextmove",
  "builtInTools": {
    "enabled": [],
